@startuml reset-feature-dataflow
title FemiGlow — Reset Feature · Flux runtime (hard reset via UI)

skinparam backgroundColor #FBF8F1
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.2

actor Admin as A
participant "Wizard\n(client)" as W
participant "API\n/api/admin/reset" as API
participant "Orchestrator" as O
participant "JobStore\n(in-memory)" as JS
participant "Phases" as P
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Filesystem" as FS

== Phase 0 · Preflight (lecture seule) ==
A -> W : ouvre /admin/settings/reset
W -> API : GET /preflight?mode=hard
API -> P : preflight()
P -> DB : SELECT counts par table
P -> FS : ls .media-storage, df -h
P --> API : { ok, plan, impact, warnings }
API --> W : 200 { plan: [...], rowCounts, mediaCount, diskFree }
W -> A : affiche Preview + Confirm

== Phase 1 · Confirmation typée ==
A -> W : tape "HARD RESET" + clique Démarrer
W -> API : POST /run\n{ mode: 'hard', preserve: ['admin_users'], confirm: 'HARD RESET' }
API -> API : validate (auth + rate-limit + Lock acquire)
API -> JS : createJob(mode, plan)
API -> O : start(job)  ' fire-and-forget
API --> W : 202 { jobId }
W -> API : EventSource GET /jobs/{jobId}/stream

== Phase 2 · Backup (obligatoire) ==
O -> JS : emit phase.start(backup)
O -> P : runBackup()
P -> FS : pg_dump → /var/backups/.../db.sql.gz
P -> FS : tar -czf media.tar.gz .media-storage/
P -> FS : write manifest.json (sizes, sha256)
P --> O : { backupId, sizes }
O -> JS : emit phase.complete(backup) + audit
JS --> W : SSE event { phase: 'backup', status: 'done' }

== Phase 3 · Audit counts (snapshot pré-reset) ==
O -> P : runAuditCounts()
P -> DB : SELECT count(*) par table critique
P --> O : { before: { products: 1, variants: 2, ... } }
O -> JS : emit phase.complete(audit)

== Phase 4 · Wipe DB ==
O -> JS : emit phase.start(wipe-db)
O -> P : runWipeDb(plan)
P -> DB : DROP SCHEMA public CASCADE
P -> DB : CREATE SCHEMA public
P -> DB : DROP SCHEMA IF EXISTS drizzle CASCADE
P --> O : { dropped: 27 tables }
O -> JS : emit phase.complete(wipe-db)

== Phase 5 · Wipe média ==
O -> JS : emit phase.start(wipe-media)
O -> P : runWipeMedia()
P -> FS : rm -rf .media-storage/*
P --> O : { removed: 596 dirs, freed: '704 MB' }
O -> JS : emit phase.complete(wipe-media)

== Phase 6 · Migrate (schema) ==
O -> JS : emit phase.start(migrate)
O -> P : runMigrate()
P -> DB : drizzle-kit migrate (applique 27 fichiers)
P --> O : { applied: 27 }
O -> JS : emit phase.complete(migrate)

== Phase 7 · Seed (16 seeders) ==
O -> JS : emit phase.start(seed)
O -> P : runSeed(SEEDERS_REGISTRY)
loop pour chaque seeder
  P -> P : seeder.run(ctx)
  P -> JS : emit seeder.progress(label, fraction)
  P -> DB : INSERT/UPSERT
  P -> FS : upload média (jpg, srcset)
  JS --> W : SSE event { seeder: 'products', fraction: 0.3 }
end
P --> O : { completed: 16, skipped: 0, errors: 0 }
O -> JS : emit phase.complete(seed)

== Phase 8 · Verify (post-reset) ==
O -> JS : emit phase.start(verify)
O -> P : runVerify()
P -> DB : SELECT count(*) (compare avec before)
P -> P : HTTP GET /kit (vérifie image + prix 199)
P -> P : HTTP GET /admin/settings (vérifie 7 cards)
P --> O : { passed: 12, failed: 0, warnings: 1 }
O -> JS : emit phase.complete(verify)

== Phase 9 · Cleanup ==
O -> P : pruneBackups(keep=5)
P -> FS : rm -rf old backups
O -> JS : emit job.complete + audit

JS --> W : SSE event { type: 'job.complete', summary: {...} }
W -> A : affiche Report (stats, lien backup, lien audit)
W -> API : close EventSource

== Cas d'erreur — auto-rollback ==
note over O,P #FFE0E0
  Si erreur phase wipe/migrate/seed après backup OK :
  Orchestrator → Restore.fromBackup(backupId)
  → restaure DB depuis db.sql.gz
  → restaure média depuis media.tar.gz
  → émet phase.complete(rollback) + audit
end note

@enduml
